{:edb/committed true :edb/basis-t 1063 :edb/replayed false :edb/tx-hash "aace2bd386171c70d49ada11cbf4b04fb8b68384ee839612e8aa5e58e8c852d1" :edb/db-before-t 1062 :edb/db-after-t 1063 :edb/tx-data [[13194139534375 50 #inst "2026-10-06T18:19:56.539Z" 13194139534375 true] [17592186091970 1100 "Find a solution to the system of linear equations\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}2x+y=2 \\\\ 4x+3y=6.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534375 true] [17592186091970 1100 "Find a solution to the system of linear equations\n\n${2x + y = 2; 4x + 3y = 6$." 13194139534375 false] [17592186091970 1145 "This system can be written as\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 \\\\ 4 & 3\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nTo find the solution, we need to calculate the inverse of the coefficient matrix $[\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 \\\\ 4 & 3\\end{aligned}]$ This gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{-1} & =\\frac{1}{3\\cdot 2-4\\cdot 1}[\\begin{aligned}3 & -1 \\\\ -4 & 2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}[\\begin{aligned}3 & -1 \\\\ -4 & 2\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now find the solution to this system:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & ={A}^{-1}b \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}[\\begin{aligned}3 & -1 \\\\ -4 & 2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 6\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo the solution is $x=0$ and $y=2.$" 13194139534375 true] [17592186091970 1145 "This system can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 1 \\\\ 4 & 3\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nTo find the solution, we need to calculate the inverse of the coefficient matrix $\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 1 \\\\ 4 & 3\\end{bmatrix}$ This gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nA^{-1} &= \\frac{1}{3 \\cdot 2 - 4 \\cdot 1}\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -1 \\\\ -4 & 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\\n&= \\frac{1}{2}\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -1 \\\\ -4 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now find the solution to this system:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nx &= A^{-1}b \\\\\n&= \\frac{1}{2}\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -1 \\\\ -4 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix} \\\\\n&= \\frac{1}{2}\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\\n&= \\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo the solution is $x=0$ and $y=2$." 13194139534375 false] [17592186091971 1100 "Solve the system of linear equations\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}2x-3y=5 \\\\ 6y-5x=-8.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534375 true] [17592186091971 1100 "Solve the system of linear equations\n\n${2x - 3y = 5; 6y - 5x =-8$." 13194139534375 false] [17592186091971 1145 "First, we reorganize the equations so that they are in the right order, to get\n\n$$\n{2x - 3y = 5; - 5x + 6y =-8\n$$\n\nNow, we can represent this system of equations in the form\n\n$$\nA\\mathbf{x} =\\mathbf{b}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -3 \\\\ -5 & 6\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nTo find the solution, we need to calculate the inverse of the coefficient matrix $\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -3 \\\\ -5 & 6\\end{bmatrix}$ This gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nA^{-1} &= \\frac{1}{6 \\cdot 2 - 3 \\cdot 5}\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 3 \\\\ 5 & 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\\n&=-\\frac{1}{3}\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 3 \\\\ 5 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now find the solution to this system:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nx &= A^{-1}b \\\\\n&=-\\frac{1}{3}\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 3 \\\\ 5 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ -8\\end{bmatrix} \\\\\n&=-\\frac{1}{3}\\begin{bmatrix}6 \\\\ 9\\end{bmatrix} \\\\\n&= \\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $x=-2$ and $y=-3$." 13194139534375 false] [17592186091971 1145 "First, we reorganize the equations so that they are in the right order, to get\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}2x-3y=5 \\\\ -5x+6y=-8.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can represent this system of equations in the form $A\\mathbf{x} =\\mathbf{b}\\mathbin{:}$\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}2 & -3 \\\\ -5 & 6\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nTo find the solution, we need to calculate the inverse of the coefficient matrix $[\\begin{aligned}2 & -3 \\\\ -5 & 6\\end{aligned}]$ This gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{-1} & =\\frac{1}{6\\cdot 2-3\\cdot 5}[\\begin{aligned}6 & 3 \\\\ 5 & 2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{3}[\\begin{aligned}6 & 3 \\\\ 5 & 2\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now find the solution to this system:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & ={A}^{-1}b \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{3}[\\begin{aligned}6 & 3 \\\\ 5 & 2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ -8\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{3}[\\begin{aligned}6 \\\\ 9\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $x=-2$ and $y=-3.$" 13194139534375 true] [17592186092130 1020 #edb/ref 17592186284741 13194139534375 true] [17592186092130 1020 #edb/ref 17592186284748 13194139534375 true] [17592186092130 1020 #edb/ref 17592186284755 13194139534375 true] [17592186092130 1020 #edb/ref 17592186284770 13194139534375 true] [17592186092130 1020 #edb/ref 17592186284777 13194139534375 true] [17592186092131 1020 #edb/ref 17592186284734 13194139534375 true] [17592186092131 1020 #edb/ref 17592186284762 13194139534375 true] [17592186092131 1020 #edb/ref 17592186284784 13194139534375 true] [17592186092131 1020 #edb/ref 17592186284791 13194139534375 true] [17592186092131 1020 #edb/ref 17592186284798 13194139534375 true] [17592186284734 1017 #edb/ref 17592186284735 13194139534375 true] [17592186284734 1089 "q-102809" 13194139534375 true] [17592186284734 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139534375 true] [17592186284734 1100 "Which of the following represents the solution to the system of linear equations given below?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}5x=1-3y \\\\ 3-4y=2x\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534375 true] [17592186284734 1113 #uuid "174955d4-f9c8-5173-abe1-fa5e22029d62" 13194139534375 true] [17592186284734 1145 "First, we reorganize the equations so that they are in the right order, to get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}5x+3y=1 \\\\ -2x-4y=-3.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$